      "cooked": "<p>I sat down to try to unlock PW Captain Cosmic today, but forgot the unlock conditions. &nbsp;(Playing on iPad Air 2). &nbsp;I opened the Sentinels app, went to \"New Game,\" selected CC, clicked the \"Variants\" banner until the locked \"Prime Wardens Captain Cosmic\" version came up. I touched that, and the banner came up with the \"Learn More\" button on it. &nbsp; I clicked \"Learn More,\" which usually takes me to the Variant cards screen, with the available unlock conditions....except it never loaded. &nbsp;Just came up blank. &nbsp;(See attached picture). &nbsp;I tried resetting my WiFi connection, using a different WiFi connection, closing and restarting the Sentinels app...no dice. &nbsp; This is not the first time this has happened, but it is the first time that no combination of resetting connection/restarting app hasn't worked. &nbsp; Any thoughts?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
